## Codebase Discoveries
vLLM v0.27.0rc1 already pins MSA 087c161, so the local 0.26 MSA patch cannot apply. DeepEP d4f41e4 requires a discoverable NCCL root and captures EP_NCCL_ROOT_DIR in the wheel. The CoreWeave torch base includes system NCCL development and runtime packages at 2.30.4-1, which meets DeepEP v2's minimum. The separately installed DeepGEMM shadows the copy vendored by vLLM. Upstream rc1's e21 line has Kimi-K3 support but no SM120 implementation, while 2fd preserves both.

